From cd35fa4a654f35442fe3c2a92fee611e48c97059 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 06:50:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gmmlib: Add 12 missing include dirs found via comprehensive
 sweep

While auditing media-driver's Android.bp for the same generator gap,
checked gmmlib's Android.bp (also produced by GenerateAndroidBp.py)
and found the same class of issue on a smaller scale: 18 header
directories missing from local_include_dirs. Checked for filename
collisions; 4 are genuine (spdlog/details, spdlog/fmt/bundled,
inc/Internal/Common, inc/Internal/Common/Texture overlapping
already-included dirs) and excluded, along with 2 test-only
ULT/googletest directories not part of the real library. Added the
remaining 12.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 Android.bp | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 6755d92..0386b88 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -133,6 +133,18 @@ cc_library_shared {
         "Source/inc",
         "Source/inc/common",
         "Source/inc/umKmInc",
+        "Source/Common/AssertTracer",
+        "Source/GmmLib/CachePolicy",
+        "Source/GmmLib/TranslationTable",
+        "Source/GmmLib/Utility/CpuSwizzleBlt",
+        "Source/GmmLib/Utility/GmmLog/spdlog",
+        "Source/GmmLib/Utility/GmmLog/spdlog/fmt",
+        "Source/GmmLib/Utility/GmmLog/spdlog/sinks",
+        "Source/GmmLib/inc/External/Common",
+        "Source/GmmLib/inc/External/Common/CachePolicy",
+        "Source/GmmLib/inc/External/Linux",
+        "Source/GmmLib/inc/Internal/Common/Platform",
+        "Source/GmmLib/inc/Internal/Linux",
     ],
 
     enabled: false,
-- 
